[['Name of Proposed Project:', 'Improvements to the Franklin-Hart County Airport'], ['Location (Street Address, GPS Coordinates, or Legal Land Lot Description):', '34-20-24.377 N'], ['Brief Description of Project:', 'The proposed project includes:
„h the extension of the existing 3500 foot by 75 foot runway approximately 1500 feet to the east (in two different phases);
„h the construction of a parallel taxiway to the south of the existing runway and runway extension; 
„h the construction of blast pads to the east and west of the runway; 
„h the relocation of the existing beacon tower segmented circle and windcone;  
„h the installation of additional medium intensity taxiway lights along the new taxiway and medium intensity runway lights along the proposed extension; 
„h the provision of new runway safety areas and runway protection zones to accommodate the extension and the addition of blast pads; and 
„h the construction of various airport buildings on the north and south side of the runway area and an access road to the buildings on the south side of the runway.   

Approximately 68.5 acres of additional property at two locations and approximately 35 acres of easements would be required for project implementation.  Approximately 40 acres of property would be required to fill the gap between the existing airport parcels to the east of the existing airport facilities.  Also approximately 28.5 acres of property would be required south of the existing airport property.'], ['Name of Proposed Project:', 'Improvements to the Franklin-Hart County Airport'], ['DRI ID Number:', '548'], ['Developer/Applicant:', 'Franklin-Hart County Airport Authority'], ['Telephone:', '(706) 491-8790'], ['Email(s):', 'mga60@yahoo.com'], ['Estimated Value at Build-Out:', '$8,403,000.'], ['Estimated annual local tax revenues (i.e., property tax, sales tax) likely to be generated by the proposed development:', '<$50,000'], ['Is the regional work force sufficient to fill the demand created by the proposed project?', 'Yes'], ['Will this development displace any existing uses?', 'Yes'], ['Name of water supply provider for this site:', 'City of Canon Water Supply'], ['What is the estimated water supply demand to be generated by the project, measured in Millions of Gallons Per Day (MGD)?', '<0.0001 MGD'], ['Is sufficient water supply capacity available to serve the proposed project?', 'Yes'], ['Is a water line extension required to serve this project?', 'Yes'], ['Name of wastewater treatment provider for this site:', 'Private disposal; no supplier provided'], ['What is the estimated sewage flow to be generated by the project, measured in Millions of Gallons Per Day (MGD)?', '<0.0001 MGD'], ['Is sufficient wastewater treatment capacity available to serve this proposed project?', 'Yes'], ['Is a sewer line extension required to serve this project?', 'Yes']]

